---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Desire Resorts Theme Nights & Costume Guide
description: "What to expect (and what to pack) for Desire Resorts' themed evening parties, from costume dress codes to nightlife at each property."
permalink: '/theme-nights/'
---

<article class="theme-nights-editorial page container">
  <header class="theme-header text-center">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Nightlife & Entertainment</span>
    <h1>Theme Nights at Desire</h1>
    <p class="hero-lead" style="max-width: var(--max-paragraph); margin: 0 auto 28px; color: var(--color-espresso-soft);">
      Dress up, dress down, or keep it simple. Here is what to expect, what to pack, and how both resorts list their evening themes.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Concierge Reassurance Banner -->
  <div class="verdict-banner text-center" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 40px;">
    <h3>Costumes Are Optional</h3>
    <p>
      Every theme dress code is a creative suggestion, not an obligation. While many guests love packing full costumes, 
      plenty of couples wear classic resort-chic attire (cocktail dresses, linen shirts) and feel right at home.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Segmented Property Filter Controls -->
  <div class="theme-filter-bar text-center">
    <span class="filter-label">Filter by Resort:</span>
    <div class="filter-pills" role="group" aria-label="Filter options">
      <button type="button" class="filter-pill is-active" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All Theme Nights</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-pill" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="drm">Desire Riviera Maya</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-pill" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="pearl">Desire Pearl</button>
    </div>
    <span id="theme-filter-status" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Showing all theme nights.</span>
  </div>

  
  <div id="theme-night-grid" class="theme-cards-grid grid-auto">
    {% for night in collections.themeNight %}
      <article class="theme-card" data-property="{{ night.data.property }}">
        <div class="theme-card__badge">
          {% if night.data.property == 'drm' %}
            Riviera Maya
          {% elif night.data.property == 'pearl' %}
            Pearl
          {% else %}
            Both Resorts
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        
        <div class="theme-card__header">
          <h3>{{ night.data.title }}</h3>
          {% if night.data.recurrence %}
            <span class="theme-recurrence">{{ night.data.recurrence }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="theme-dress-code">
          <span class="dress-label">Suggested Dress:</span>
          <p class="dress-val">{{ night.data.dressCode }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="theme-body">
          {{ night.templateContent | safe }}
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <!-- Packing Guidance Strip -->
  <section class="packing-advice-strip">
    <div class="packing-content">
      <h3>Theme Night Packing Advice</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Lingerie & Accessories Do Double Duty:</strong> A simple bustier, harness, or lace piece paired with shorts or a skirt easily fits themes like <em>Between the Sheets</em> or <em>Boop's Boudoir</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Men's Standard:</strong> Nice dark shorts, tailored linen pants, and breathable collared shirts fit almost any evening theme.</li>
        <li><strong>Pack for 2&ndash;3 Themes Max:</strong> If you are staying 5 to 7 nights, picking 2 or 3 themes to lean into is more than enough. You do not need to pack a separate checked bag just for costumes.</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
        <a href="/#availability" class="btn btn--primary">Check Availability</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>


  <section class="first-timer-next-step" aria-labelledby="first-timer-next-heading">
    <div class="first-timer-next-step__content">
      <span class="ft-card__label">06</span>
      <h2 id="first-timer-next-heading">Next: Review Etiquette & House Rules</h2>
      <p>Before your first trip, review the practical guidance around communication, boundaries, photography, and house rules.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/etiquette/" class="editorial-btn editorial-btn--outline">Read the Etiquette Guide &rarr;</a>
  </section>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const pills = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-pill');
    const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.theme-card');

    pills.forEach(pill => {
      pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
        pills.forEach(p => { p.classList.remove('is-active'); p.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); });
        pill.classList.add('is-active');
        pill.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');

        const filter = pill.dataset.filter;

        const status = document.getElementById('theme-filter-status');
        if (status) status.textContent = filter === 'all' ? 'Showing all theme nights.' : `Showing ${pill.textContent.trim()} theme nights.`;

        cards.forEach(card => {
          if (filter === 'all' || card.dataset.property === filter || card.dataset.property === 'both') {
            card.style.display = 'flex';
          } else {
            card.style.display = 'none';
          }
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>